cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the archived measurement records, please cite
  both the software and the paper it accompanies.
title: >-
  Exact phylogenetic distance deconvolution: solvers, instance bank and
  measurement records
abstract: >-
  Exact rational algorithms for the minimum source count in phylogenetic
  distance deconvolution, the frozen instance bank built from published
  reference phylogenies, and the saved records behind the measurements of what
  incomplete reference sets cost.
